<title>SWEDEN: Sandvik says to buy Precision Twist Drill.</title>
<headline>Sandvik says to buy Precision Twist Drill.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish speciality tool maker Sandvik said on Thursday it had entered an agreement to buy U.S. twist drill maker Precision Twist Drill Co.</p>
</text>
